OL,3,GNEWSAFerry timetable changes hit
OL,4,ALiverpool trips
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers who had booked day trips to
OL,7,FLiverpool next month will have to
OL,8,Fchange their plans now the Isle of Man
OL,9,FSteam Packet Company brought forward
OL,10,Ffour weekend return sailings.
OL,12,FThe Liverpool to Isle of Man crossings
OL,13,Fon 7, 14, 21 and 28 November will now
OL,14,Fdepart at 13:30 GMT instead of 19:00.
OL,16,FThe company said the change was due to
OL,17,Ftidal and operational issues.
OL,19,FThe revised timetable comes as the
OL,20,FBen-my-Chree continues to cover the
OL,21,Fmain Heysham route while the flagship
OL,22,FManxman undergoes repairs.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
